# Vendor Onboarding Procedure

Vendor onboarding begins when a sponsoring team files an intake form naming the vendor, the business need, and the data the vendor will touch. The form is the single entry point; procurement declines to progress vendors that arrive through informal channels, however urgent the request.

[1] doc-07-vendor-faq.md#0 (chars 0-330)
# Vendor FAQ

How long does vendor onboarding take? For a vendor touching only public data the median is nine working days from intake form to signed contract. For a vendor touching customer data it is closer to six weeks, and almost all of the additional time is spent waiting for the vendor to return the security questionnaire.
